    36	
    37	"Fed, and asleep when we left. Pike's keeping him till the mule's fit to climb."
    38	
    39	Something in her face eased by the width of a hair.
    40	
    41	"Your boxes are up the ladder. Supper's when it's dark, in the house, and you'll eat at my board, since you're hired." She turned toward the long door. "There's a man in there you'll want to hear. You'll hear him once."
