   195	# ARC 3 — THE WORLD
   196	**Books 7–9 | Ages 18–20 (drafted: B7 18→19 on the page, in autumn; B8 nineteen throughout — it runs winter's end to summer; B9 19→20 in autumn; the pre-drafting band read 20–22 — superseded) | Antagonist: The Quieting**
   197	
   198	The arc where the world gets larger and the true threat becomes visible.
   199	
