   240	
   241	They ate every one.
   242	
   243	*Twenty-fourth day. Second line: forty posts, cut and set. Four marks and flour. He said "Cheap," and Brom has kept the word. Earned, six. At dusk the sealed one took my left foot for a stride, on an empty road. Rent. Deployment since the Line: none.*
