    37	The woman had been looking at the cart. She lifted the edge of the small canvas and saw three roped boxes on top of her grain, with a paper tag on each. She let the canvas down. Then she raised the lantern a little, for the first time, and went over the five of them with it, their boots and their coats and the cut of Lira's hair, and stopped at Cael.
