    50	
    51	- **Deployment since the Line: one** (the ford burst), from day 53 onward. No other fragment use, private or public. **Shadow unused.**
    52	- Quiet ground stays three sentences from a carter's wife. Nobody asks Pike or anyone else. No healer or Tide practitioner appears; "the nearest walks a route and she's not due" is the only reference.
    53	- The ankle never gets a healer in this movement, and it is never mended in this book.
    54	- Teague is absent: on the cold road, then back and out again on hold slips. No meeting. [B6-reconciled 2026-10-11: audit A2]
