    58	
    59	The fight's micro-geometry within the planted terrain; how the seam is seen; the barn table's details; which carter says what; the well's hazard; Lira's runs; the humor (Lira on the cart's tail announcing it was her decision; Brom's two-word sentences; Karis made to dictate). Where the Lira and Karis windows sit.
    60	
