    62	
    63	Day 69: twelfth, Teague eleven up. Four of five healing slow or wrong, with a calf, a forearm, two palms and an ankle that will never be straight. Fifty-two in hand. A rumor with two lines under it in the middle box. A board with a well's line on it and, soon, a hold's slip from a ford nobody has heard of.
