+## 7. Names
+
+**PASS.** No person, place, or animal is newly named outside the plan. Cael, Lira, Brom, Karis, Seln, Pike, Teague, Hesk, Lowmarch, Thornwater, Denvash, Ardenmere, Norhold, Fenmark, and Ternhall are pre-existing canon or map names (`BOOK_MAP.md:19-35,137-153`; `STATE_LEDGER.md:159-160`; chapters 8–14 throughout). The hold's people, both carters, wife, children, shingle pair, survivor, hounds, and mules remain unnamed (`manuscript/chapter-08.md:15-19`; `manuscript/chapter-09.md:77-109`; `manuscript/chapter-12.md:269-315`; `manuscript/chapter-14.md:331-335`). No owner-supplied name is needed.
